From 629527e5ff80139230b0909f48da9a0a0417f2ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 23:38:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix: escape device information as XML text

Identity values containing XML metacharacters produce malformed device
information responses. Render identity templates through the shared XML
substitution helper so values retain their literal text and the renderer
escapes them during serialisation. Preserve compressed template support
and literal placeholder strings in identity values.

Fixes: e1c34ca6dd91 ("First commit")
Signed-off-by: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
